{
 "description": "Re-run the exact Domain Solutioning case/result validation, then validate one caller-supplied Actualization Plan. Checks typed entity references, evidence references, decision cycles, source binding, and false authority. Success returns evidence linkage plus exact review_specification calls for unblocked fabricated parts, copied only from each caller-authored function and specification_patch. Rejection can append a tamper-evident correction entry to caller-held history. Stores, edits, and executes nothing; calls no model, provider, or supplier; grants no physical authority.",
